WEBVTT

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:10.803
[gasps]

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:12.471
[growls]

00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:14.056
That's him!

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.101
Yep! Just-- Just join those hands.

00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:18.269
Look! Look!

00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:20.020
-No need to look at 'em.
-Come on, come on...

00:00:20.104 --> 00:00:21.605
Just blindly join those hands together.

00:00:21.689 --> 00:00:23.440
- I object!
-[guests gasp]

00:00:23.524 --> 00:00:24.858
What?

00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:26.026
-[Wolf gasps]
-Honey-bunny!

00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:28.320
[exclaims]

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:30.447
Soliman, who do you think you are?

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:32.199
Moon! Look what you are marrying.

00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:35.536
It's none other than the Big Bad Wolf!

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:36.829
[guests gasp]

00:00:37.413 --> 00:00:39.623
Here comes the bride!

00:00:39.707 --> 00:00:41.208
-Boop!
-[exclaims]

00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:42.418
How could this be? He was here.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:43.919
Soli-wolly, this is a disgrace.

00:00:44.003 --> 00:00:45.879
-Get him out of here, now!
-Where are you taking me?

00:00:45.963 --> 00:00:47.673
There are witnesses. We all saw it.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:48.799
Huh?

00:00:49.383 --> 00:00:52.011
-Hey, where's the officiant?
-Who cares?

00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:53.846
[guests cheer, applaud]

00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:59.101
[all laughing]

00:01:00.436 --> 00:01:04.857
Definitely top five Bad Guys heist ever!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.901
When big man say, "I object!"

00:01:07.985 --> 00:01:10.195
I almost make pee-pee accident.

00:01:10.279 --> 00:01:11.655
[all laugh]

00:01:12.323 --> 00:01:13.991
Right. Almost.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:17.077
Wolf, I-I gotta ask.

00:01:17.161 --> 00:01:18.871
How'd you know that was gonna work?

00:01:18.954 --> 00:01:22.458
You see, Kitty,
there's three parts to every con.

00:01:22.541 --> 00:01:24.335
[exciting music playing]

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:27.338
[Wolf] First, bait the hook.

00:01:35.804 --> 00:01:37.014
[gasps]

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.766
Then comes the turn.

00:01:38.849 --> 00:01:40.517
Something weird is going on.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:41.852
Someone should object.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:42.978
- I object!
-[guests gasp]

00:01:43.062 --> 00:01:45.064
[Wolf] But none of it works
without the payoff.

00:01:45.731 --> 00:01:47.024
'Cause it's one thing to steal the watch...

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:48.442
[Moon] Soliman, who do you think you are?

00:01:48.525 --> 00:01:49.526
[both shushing]

00:01:50.152 --> 00:01:51.403
Hold on tight, bellissima.

00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:55.699
[Wolf] ...and another fo get away with it.

00:01:56.867 --> 00:01:59.244
...the Big Bad Wolf!

00:01:59.745 --> 00:02:02.206
The art of misdirection.

00:02:02.289 --> 00:02:04.625
It's not the action, it's the distraction.

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:06.668
-Got it.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:07.961
Hey! [laughs]

00:02:08.045 --> 00:02:10.714
-All right, I see you.
-[Wolf chuckles]

00:02:10.798 --> 00:02:12.800
[Pigtail] Oh, I love weddings!

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.101
Hmm.

00:02:22.184 --> 00:02:23.727
No.

00:02:23.811 --> 00:02:25.187
Not there.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:28.232
No. Maybe... [groans]

00:02:28.315 --> 00:02:30.567
-So many options.
-Oh, my goodness.

00:02:30.651 --> 00:02:32.611
Can we move this along?

00:02:32.694 --> 00:02:33.695
Patience, Diane!

00:02:33.779 --> 00:02:36.532
This is a game of subtle strategy
and psychological endurance

00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:40.077
mastered only by the most cunning
and sophisticated minds.

00:02:40.869 --> 00:02:43.205
"Ages six and up."

00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:46.875
Besides, it's not every day
that the governor drops by

00:02:46.959 --> 00:02:48.961
to chat about quantum ferromagnetism.

00:02:50.629 --> 00:02:51.630
Quantu--

00:02:51.713 --> 00:02:55.134
Wait, are you saying
MacGuffinite is magnetic?

00:02:56.343 --> 00:02:57.970
Not just a magnet.

00:02:58.053 --> 00:03:01.390
MacGuffinite is
the atomic inverse of gold.

00:03:01.473 --> 00:03:03.183
Exposed to extreme voltage...

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:07.104
It will cause gold electrons to decouple
and attract with spectacular force.

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.480
It's a gold magnet!

00:03:08.564 --> 00:03:10.482
Oh, she's catching on.

00:03:10.566 --> 00:03:13.152
-[gasps]
-Very good!

00:03:13.735 --> 00:03:17.906
Why rob a bank when you can
make the gold come to you?

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.784
All the crime, none of the exercise.

00:03:21.743 --> 00:03:23.078
Thanks, Professor.

00:03:23.162 --> 00:03:24.496
Whoa, whoa, whoa. You can't go.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.747
We haven't finished our--

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.209
What? No! But how?

00:03:29.293 --> 00:03:31.211
It's literally tic-tac-toe.

00:03:31.295 --> 00:03:32.671
Send me your yearbook?

00:03:34.465 --> 00:03:36.133
You know, it's funny.

00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:39.094
You're the second person
to come all the way here

00:03:39.178 --> 00:03:40.596
to ask me about MacGuffinite.

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:45.100
What are the odds?

00:03:45.976 --> 00:03:47.311
You had a visitor?

00:03:48.103 --> 00:03:49.521
I didn't get her name,

00:03:49.605 --> 00:03:52.316
but apparently we have a friend in common.

00:03:52.399 --> 00:03:53.525
Or should I say...

00:03:54.443 --> 00:03:55.444
five?

00:03:56.528 --> 00:03:57.696
[laughing]

00:04:04.995 --> 00:04:06.371
[splutters] Madam Governor.

00:04:06.455 --> 00:04:08.123
I need footage
of Marmalade's last visitor.

00:04:08.207 --> 00:04:09.208
Now.

00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:11.293
[tense music playing]

00:04:12.294 --> 00:04:13.587
[grunts]

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.185
Found you.

00:04:42.199 --> 00:04:43.659
-But can I drive?
-No.

00:04:43.742 --> 00:04:46.036
[Pigtail] This was
new best day of my life!

00:04:46.119 --> 00:04:49.122
[sighs] Why must you leave forever?

00:04:49.206 --> 00:04:51.208
Oh, cheer up, Buttersnout.

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:52.584
[gasps] Buttersnout?

00:04:53.168 --> 00:04:55.921
-I always wanted a nickname.
-Uh, great.

00:04:56.004 --> 00:04:57.673
[both laugh]

00:04:57.756 --> 00:05:00.801
Hey, listen, uh, no hard feelings
about the whole, you know,

00:05:00.884 --> 00:05:03.595
pretend relationship to entrap you
and your buddies, okay?

00:05:03.679 --> 00:05:06.181
Oh, come on, now. Of course not.

00:05:06.265 --> 00:05:09.810
I mean, to be honest,
I wasn't really that into you.

00:05:10.394 --> 00:05:11.395
Weird.

00:05:11.478 --> 00:05:14.648
"Cause you, uh,
you seemed pretty into me.

00:05:14.731 --> 00:05:17.025
Well, that's... [chuckles]

00:05:17.109 --> 00:05:18.318
-Yeah?
-That's...

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:20.654
You know, I didn't wanna
hurt your feelings, so, uh...

00:05:20.737 --> 00:05:22.573
Yeah, sorry,
if you're disappointed.

00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:24.199
Oh, no, no, no, no, not me.

00:05:24.283 --> 00:05:27.244
You see, uh, I'd only be
disappointed if I was into you

00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:31.915
which, as previously established,
I was not, okay?

00:05:31.999 --> 00:05:33.125
Of course.

00:05:33.208 --> 00:05:37.963
Otherwise, this marshmallow toast
would be full of romantic tension.

00:05:38.046 --> 00:05:39.089
Hmm.

00:05:39.172 --> 00:05:40.215
[reggae playing on radio]

00:05:40.299 --> 00:05:43.093
[Kitty] Yeah. Of course I did.

00:05:43.176 --> 00:05:44.177
[Wolf] Oh, really?

00:05:44.678 --> 00:05:47.639
So impersonating the bride was your idea?

00:05:47.723 --> 00:05:49.641
-[Kitty] Absolutely.
-[Wolf] Yeah. Okay.

00:05:49.725 --> 00:05:50.934
I hired you.

00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:53.395
Therefore, your ideas are my ideas.

00:05:53.478 --> 00:05:54.479
Classy.

00:05:54.563 --> 00:05:56.106
What's going on
with the MacGuffinite?

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:58.066
Oh, just a little science project.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.902
Huh. So you framed us for science?

00:06:00.986 --> 00:06:04.114
[laughs] Come on, I had to frame you.

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.783
It was the only way
to draw you out of retirement.

00:06:06.867 --> 00:06:07.909
[chuckles]

00:06:08.493 --> 00:06:10.954
Anyway, you got what you wanted, so, uh...

00:06:12.623 --> 00:06:14.291
Oh. [chuckles] Oh!

00:06:14.374 --> 00:06:17.127
Right. You want the video.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:20.756
There we go.

00:06:21.715 --> 00:06:23.467
-Oh, man.

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:26.178
Did-- Did I ever tell you
about my first heist?

00:06:26.261 --> 00:06:28.013
Uh, no. Um...

00:06:28.096 --> 00:06:30.223
Was it a bank?
Jewelry store? What was it?

00:06:31.350 --> 00:06:32.517
Lollipop.

00:06:33.101 --> 00:06:38.023
Back in school, we had a teacher
who used to give the good kids a lollipop.

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:44.237
And maybe it was my claws or my teeth,
but she never, ever looked my way.

00:06:44.321 --> 00:06:45.530
It was hurtful.

00:06:46.114 --> 00:06:49.076
So one day, when the old fart
wasn't looking,

00:06:49.159 --> 00:06:52.621
I snuck into the drawer
and swiped the whole bag.

00:06:52.704 --> 00:06:56.958
[chuckles] After that,
when the kids wanted lollipops,

00:06:57.042 --> 00:06:58.710
they came to me.

00:06:59.294 --> 00:07:01.338
Dude, it was amazing, man.

00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:05.092
For the first time in my life,
I felt powerful.

00:07:06.301 --> 00:07:08.929
I must have pulled off
a hundred jobs since then.

00:07:09.513 --> 00:07:12.974
And the more you steal,
the more they respect you.

00:07:13.475 --> 00:07:14.476
Hmm.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.646
Why would you give that up?

00:07:20.148 --> 00:07:24.820
You think if you play nice
and follow their rules,

00:07:24.903 --> 00:07:28.699
they'll just see you
for who you truly are.

00:07:29.408 --> 00:07:31.702
But let me tell you, they won't.

00:07:32.869 --> 00:07:35.414
What if the bad life was your best life?

00:07:36.331 --> 00:07:38.083
My advice:

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:43.964
stop hoping and enjoy the lollipop.

